flowchart TD
    S([Both model predictions + claim features]) --> C1{Classes match?}
    C1 -- No --> MD[Model Disagreement]
    C1 -- Yes --> C2{Either top confidence<br/>below min_confidence 0.60?}
    C2 -- Yes --> UR[Uncertain Result]
    C2 -- No --> C3{"Difference <= 0.10 and<br/>both >= 0.80?"}
    C3 -- Yes --> SM[Strong Match]
    C3 -- No --> C4{"Difference <= 0.20 and<br/>both >= 0.70?"}
    C4 -- Yes --> AM[Acceptable Match]
    C4 -- No --> WM[Weak Match]

    MD & UR & SM & AM & WM --> R1{Any hard-fail rule failed?<br/>expired beyond grace, excluded damage,<br/>too many repairs, prior replacement}
    R1 -- Yes --> LI[Likely Invalid]
    R1 -- No --> R2{Contradiction found?<br/>fault before purchase, serial mismatch}
    R2 -- Yes --> MR[Manual Review Required]
    R2 -- No --> R3{Warning rule failed?<br/>missing mandatory documents}
    R3 -- Yes --> MR
    R3 -- No --> R4{Consistency is Disagreement,<br/>Uncertain or Weak, or either<br/>model says Manual Review?}
    R4 -- Yes --> MR
    R4 -- No --> R5{Both models say?}
    R5 -- Invalid Claim --> LI
    R5 -- Valid Claim --> LV[Likely Valid]
    R5 -- Other --> MR
